**Why this is not a profit figure:**
The server explicitly flags the Profit & Loss status as {{v15}} because a bank statement or cashflow record is not a Profit & Loss statement. The difference between inflow and outflow reflects changes in cash liquidity, not revenue minus expenses. Profit requires accounting for accrued revenues, expenses, and non-cash items, which are not captured in settled cash movements.

